# 2. `RealityRouter`

This one I really like.

```http
POST /resolve
```

Goal:

```text
"Check whether building X still exists."
```

Your system determines:

```text
Method A: local human       $3.40 / 40 min / confidence .99
Method B: Street View       $0.01 / 2 sec / freshness 8 months
Method C: merchant call     $0.40 / 4 min / confidence .87
Method D: satellite image   $1.20 / 30 sec / confidence .72
```

Then chooses according to constraints.

That's analogous to an LLM router except for **reality acquisition**.

Potentially very powerful.

